<title>UK: SGA sets call warrants on ENI shares.</title>
<headline>SGA sets call warrants on ENI shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale Acceptance NV has issued 20 million American-style call warrants on ENI SpA shares, lead manager Societe Generale said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    9000 ITL		  PREMIUM	11.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1003 ITL		  GEARING	8.9 X</p>
<p> EXPIRTION	 23.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	21.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  8985 ITL</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
